EE function override mechanism for ps2-web-recomp (tool-tree part only).

The Lifeline voice module is NOT in this patch. Its single source of truth is
<repo-root>/ourcode/voice/ (MIT). Build with:
  eerecomp <elf> --overrides <repo-root>/ourcode/voice/overrides.txt --out generated/<name>
  cmake ... -DPS2_EXTRA_SOURCES="$V/voice_overrides.cpp;$V/vgp.cpp;$V/result_writer.cpp;$V/null_recognizer.cpp"
  with V=<repo-root>/ourcode/voice

